{"meta":{"ui":"question_flow","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Help me pick a laptop with a short question flow, one question at a time, with progress (Question 1 of 3) and a Back button. Question 1: what I use it for (School or study, Work and office, Gaming, Creative projects). Question 2 depends on it: for Gaming ask \"What do you play?\" with Competitive esports or Big open-world titles; otherwise ask what matters most (All-day battery, A big screen and keyboard, As light as possible). Question 3: budget (Under $800, $800 to $1,500, Over $1,500). End on one recommendation with two reasons that repeat my answers and a Start over button: Gaming gets the Volt 16 Gaming at $1,399, Creative projects the Studio 14 Pro at $1,799, and anyone else the Slate 13 at $649 if the budget is under $800, otherwise the Aero 14 at $1,099.","text":"ChatCard \"Find your laptop\" \"Three quick questions\" icon:\"laptop_mac\" status:\"Question 1 of 3\" tone:accent\n  state use=\"\"\n  state play=\"\"\n  state matters=\"\"\n  state budget=\"\"\n  state step=1\n  if step==1\n    SectionLabel \"Question 1 of 3\" \"What for\"\n    OptionList =use options:[\"School or study\",\"Work and office\",\"Gaming\",\"Creative projects\"] -> step=2\n  if step==2 && use==\"Gaming\"\n    SectionLabel \"Question 2 of 3\" \"Your games\"\n    OptionList =play options:[\"Competitive esports\",\"Big open-world titles\"] -> step=3\n  if step==2 && use!=\"Gaming\"\n    SectionLabel \"Question 2 of 3\" \"What matters most\"\n    OptionList =matters options:[\"All-day battery\",\"A big screen and keyboard\",\"As light as possible\"] -> step=3\n  if step==3\n    SectionLabel \"Question 3 of 3\" \"Your budget\"\n    OptionList =budget options:[\"Under $800\",\"$800 to $1,500\",\"Over $1,500\"] -> step=4\n  if step>1 && step<4\n    Row gap:10\n      ActionButton \"Back\" quiet icon:\"arrow_back\" -> step=step-1\n  if step==4\n    Receipt \"Your match\" \"Based on your answers\" tone:good icon:\"check\"\n    Details rows:=[[\"Use\",use],[\"Priority\",coalesce(play,matters,\"\")],[\"Budget\",budget]]\n    if use==\"Gaming\"\n      Recommendation \"Volt 16 Gaming\" \"Built for play at $1,399.\" reasons:=[\"Fits your gaming plans\",\"Within your budget range\"] eyebrow:\"Gaming\"\n    if use==\"Creative projects\"\n      Recommendation \"Studio 14 Pro\" \"Built for creative work at $1,799.\" reasons:=[\"Suited to creative projects\",\"Top-end screen and power\"] eyebrow:\"Creative\"\n    if use!=\"Gaming\" && use!=\"Creative projects\" && budget==\"Under $800\"\n      Recommendation \"Slate 13\" \"A light, affordable pick at $649.\" reasons:=[\"Matches your use\",\"Fits under $800\"] eyebrow:\"Best value\"\n    if use!=\"Gaming\" && use!=\"Creative projects\" && budget!=\"Under $800\"\n      Recommendation \"Aero 14\" \"A balanced laptop at $1,099.\" reasons:=[\"Matches your use\",\"Fits your budget\"] eyebrow:\"Best balance\"\n    ActionButton \"Start over\" quiet icon:\"refresh\" -> use=\"\"; play=\"\"; matters=\"\"; budget=\"\"; step=1","usage":{"input_tokens":9209,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":877,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":593,"totalMs":3751}}
